          "Missing, unavailable, and confirmed negative values belong in separate fields. The note should let the next reviewer see which parts were checked and which were assumed. Every no-show record needs an observation time, because a later reader cannot infer it from context. Judgment stays with the revenue lead; the SDR records only what was checked and when."
